MARMALADE BOY

00:22:35.392 --> 00:22:37.826
PART—TIME JOB —
"THE WAR OF LOVE
DEPENDS ON SALES."

00:22:54.378 --> 00:23:00.544
Seiza—tachiga kirameite. ..
hizuke o kaeru

00:23:02.119 --> 00:23:08.422
Yosoyuki—gao ga ko cha ni...
sotto tokeru no

00:23:08.792 --> 00:23:16.927
Tada no watashi ni...
modoru shunkan

00:23:17.635 --> 00:23:22.800
Mada mada ima
wa nemuresou ni nai...

00:23:24.208 --> 00:23:27.268
Totsuzen—sugiru. ..

00:23:28.045 --> 00:23:31.913
Atarashii tokimeki ni

00:23:37.121 --> 00:23:39.555
Okashi—na kimochi yo

00:23:39.690 --> 00:23:47.324
Tatta hitori no...
dareka ni kawatteyuku...

00:23:47.898 --> 00:23:54.929
Sonna yokan. ..
dakishimeteitai. ..

00:23:55.506 --> 00:23:59.067
Nemuru made...
